    "description": "Edit a dashboard, chart or SQL chart with an RFC6902 patch against its JSON as readContent last returned it; the edited content is validated before it is saved. A SQL chart needs the SQL chart save permission and, in agent threads, SQL mode; a patch that changes its sql waits for user approval of the new SQL.",
