  {
    "description": "Tool: getMetadata

Purpose:
Get the full metadata for explores and fields whose IDs you already know, typically from grepFields: an explore's joined tables, table filters, and parameters, and a field's filter type, case-sensitivity, resolved default time dimension, parameter dependencies, hints, and whether it comes from a joined table.

When to use:
Call this once you have narrowed down to the explores and fields you intend to use, before building the query. Batch every explore and field you need into one call. Descriptions and hints truncated elsewhere ("...(truncated)") are returned here in full.

Inputs:
Each entry in \`requests\` is one of:
- \`{ "type": "explore", "exploreIds": ["orders", "customers"] }\` for whole explores.
- \`{ "type": "field", "fields": [{ "exploreId": "orders", "fieldId": "orders_status" }] }\` for specific fields.

Applying the result:
Use a metric's default time dimension unless the user asks for a different one.
",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "definitions": {
        "__schema0": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "exploreIds": {
                  "description": "Explore IDs (names) to fetch full metadata for.",
                  "items": {
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "type": "string",
                  },
                  "minItems": 1,
                  "type": "array",
                },
                "type": {
                  "const": "explore",
                  "type": "string",
                },
              },
              "required": [
                "type",
                "exploreIds",
              ],
              "type": "object",
            },
            {
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "fields": {
                  "description": "Specific fields to fetch full metadata for.",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/definitions/__schema2",
                  },
                  "minItems": 1,
                  "type": "array",
                },
                "type": {
                  "const": "field",
                  "type": "string",
                },
              },
              "required": [
                "type",
                "fields",
              ],
              "type": "object",
            },
          ],
        },
        "__schema2": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "exploreId": {
              "description": "The explore the field belongs to.",
              "minLength": 1,
              "type": "string",
            },
            "fieldId": {
              "description": "The fieldId, e.g. \`orders_status\`.",
              "minLength": 1,
              "type": "string",
            },
          },
          "required": [
            "exploreId",
            "fieldId",
          ],
          "type": "object",
        },
      },
      "properties": {
        "requests": {
          "description": "A batch of explore and/or field metadata requests, resolved together in one call.",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/__schema0",
          },
          "maxItems": 20,
          "minItems": 1,
          "type": "array",
        },
      },
      "required": [
        "requests",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
